 "gates": {
  "R0": "recompute per-member axis-A and axis-B AUROC, the paired A-B delta with its prompt-clustered CI, and the within-stratum AUROC, from proj_<KEY>.npz + proj_<KEY>_items.json alone using explib.centre_by_stratum and explib.detection_stats IMPORTED from the archive; require max|delta| <= 1e-06 on every member x axis cell.  Also re-derive labels from lib/classify.REFUSAL_RE.match(item['text']) and assert byte-equality with the stored npz labels array.  On ANY failure emit REPRODUCTION_FAILED and stop before any restatement.",
